  <h3>Concrete next fit: extending <code>news_features.py</code> with an LLM stage</h3>

  <p>
    Today's pipeline (Lesson 0007 reminder):
  </p>
  <p class="small">
    Alpha Vantage transformer → <code>sentiment</code> scalar → your aggregations → GBM
  </p>

  <p>
    An LLM-augmented version (<em>not</em> yet in the repo, but trivial to add):
  </p>

