      <li data-correct="true"  data-why="Correct — this is classic RAG: embed the relevant CSV rows and Markdown chunks, retrieve the top-K most relevant on each query, stuff them into the LLM context, return the answer. Updates instantly when new backtests run. Cheaper, simpler, more transparent than fine-tuning.">RAG: embed the equity/blotter CSVs and CLAUDE.md into a vector store; retrieve the top-K relevant chunks per query; stuff into the LLM context; answer with citations.</li>
